<!--
    Status-bar icon for push notifications. OneSignal looks for a drawable with
    exactly this name and falls back to the launcher icon when it is missing,
    which Android renders as a plain white square.

    Android masks notification icons to a single colour, so this must be a
    white-on-transparent silhouette — colour here would be discarded anyway.
-->
